id:                     E544
trigger_tool:           ld|clang|cmake
phase:                  linking
error_signature:        undefined reference to 'google::protobuf::internal::EpsCopyInputStream::VerifyUTF8Fallback|undefined reference to .*utf8_validity.*|undefined reference to .*Utf8Validate.*

severity:               2
category:               build-system, linking, compat
match_keywords:         EpsCopyInputStream, VerifyUTF8Fallback, libutf8_range, libutf8_validity, protobuf 33, undefined reference, 手工链接, protobuf::libprotoc, imported target
title:                  protobuf 33 把 utf8 校验拆为 libutf8_range/libutf8_validity 独立库，手工拼链接清单遗漏导致 VerifyUTF8Fallback 未解析

root_cause: protobuf 33 起 utf8 校验拆分为独立静态库 libutf8_range.a 与 libutf8_validity.a，
  且拆分只体现在 CMake imported target 链上（protobuf::libprotobuf 的
  INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES 含 utf8_range::utf8_validity → utf8_range::utf8_range）；
  手工拼 clang++ 链接清单（libprotoc.a libprotobuf.a + absl 列表）时必然遗漏这两个库，
  报 undefined reference to EpsCopyInputStream::VerifyUTF8Fallback
affected_scope: 所有静态链接 protobuf 33 libprotoc/libprotobuf 的手工链接命令、非 CMake
  构建脚本（Makefile/直连命令行）；典型为自研 protoc 插件
verification_cmd: ls <conan_package>/lib/libutf8_range.a <conan_package>/lib/libutf8_validity.a && grep -A3 "add_library(protobuf::libprotobuf" <pkg>/lib/cmake/protobuf/protobuf-targets.cmake | grep utf8

rec_priority:            1
rec_approach:            cmake-imported-target-link
rec_description:         用 CMake find_package(Protobuf CONFIG REQUIRED) + target_link_libraries(... protobuf::libprotoc) 让 conan 依赖图自动解析 utf8_range/validity/absl 全链；Protobuf_DIR/utf8_range_DIR/absl_DIR 三个变量直指包内 config 目录
rec_command:             find_package(Protobuf CONFIG REQUIRED) → target_link_libraries(protoc-gen-grpc-web PRIVATE protobuf::libprotoc)
rec_auto_fix:            false
rec_impl:                manual-cmake

fallback_priority:       2
fallback_approach:        manual-link-complete-list
fallback_description:    无法用 CMake 时手工补齐链接清单：在原清单上追加 <pkg>/lib/libutf8_range.a <pkg>/lib/libutf8_validity.a（顺序放在 libprotobuf.a 之后）
fallback_command:         clang++ ... <pkg>/lib/libprotoc.a <pkg>/lib/libprotobuf.a <pkg>/lib/libutf8_validity.a <pkg>/lib/libutf8_range.a <absl libs...>
fallback_auto_fix:       false
fallback_impl:

forbid_1_pattern:        .*libprotobuf\.a(?!.*utf8).*
forbid_1_reason:          手工清单只链 libprotoc/libprotobuf 而不带 utf8 两库，protobuf 33 下必然漏
forbid_1_consequence:     链接期 undefined reference to EpsCopyInputStream::VerifyUTF8Fallback

causes:                  []
caused_by:               []
similar_to:              [E014]
conflicts_with:          []
prerequisite_of:         [E543]

doc_file:                doc/E544.md
last_updated: 2026-09-07
source_event:            protoc-gen-grpc-web 2.1.1 手工链接 grpc_generator.o + protobuf 库清单时报 EpsCopyInputStream::VerifyUTF8Fallback 未解析；改用 CMake protobuf::libprotoc target 后链接通过

